@Ts_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

GET {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Congelados",
  "fulfillmentMode": "FrozenStock"
}

###

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/production/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estrogonofe de frango"
}

### Oferta diária para compor um Pedido misto

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Almoço do dia",
  "fulfillmentMode": "DailyProduction"
}

### Substitua os IDs pelos recursos criados acima

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/frozen-stock/configurations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "producibleItemId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "presentation": "300 g",
  "quantityPerUnit": 300,
  "measurementUnit": "Gram",
  "unitPrice": 24.90
}

### Substitua o ID pela configuração criada acima

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/frozen-stock/production-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: frozen-production-2026-09-04-01

{
  "frozenConfigurationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "manufacturedOn": "2026-09-04",
  "producedQuantity": 24,
  "actorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Configure a capacidade; na primeira gravação, a versão esperada é zero

PUT {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/daily-capacities/2026-09-05
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: capacity-2026-09-05-01

{
  "totalUnits": 40,
  "expectedVersion": 0
}

### Consulte capacidade total, reservada, disponível e versão

GET {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/daily-capacities/2026-09-05
Accept: application/json

### Crie o Pedido; substitua os IDs pelas ofertas/configuração criadas acima

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-create-2026-09-05-01

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "operationalDate": "2026-09-05",
  "items": [
    {
      "offerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 18.00
    },
    {
      "offerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "quantity": 3,
      "frozenConfigurationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
    }
  ]
}

### Consulte o Pedido e use a versão devolvida nas escritas seguintes

GET {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### A edição substitui o rascunho inteiro e exige versão otimista

PUT {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-edit-2026-09-05-01

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "operationalDate": "2026-09-05",
  "expectedVersion": 0,
  "items": [
    {
      "offerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 18.00
    }
  ]
}

### Confirme usando a versão atual devolvida pela criação, edição ou consulta

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirmation
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-confirmation-2026-09-04-01

{
  "actorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "expectedVersion": 0
}
